('025e1ff6-9f27-4a93-b3c8-9fb0fe5ddae6', '55ca712661ae75bfcb491cef3f79700d', 'assistant', '**Design concept (English)**  \n- **Format:** Facebook feed banner – 1200 × 400 px (`generic-banner`).  \n- **Background:** Diagonal gradient from dark brand shade to the primary brand color for a tech‑savvy vibe.  \n- **Top‑left badge:** Bright “FLASH SALE” pill in ember‑red to catch the eye instantly.  \n- **Headline:** Large, bold “Electronics Flash Sale” on the left side, stacked for impact.  \n- **Sub‑headline:** Smaller supporting copy highlighting “Up to 70 % OFF on top brands – limited time only!”  \n- **CTA button:** Prominent brand‑accent pill with “Shop Now →” to drive clicks.  \n- **Right‑side visual:** A dark‑stone rectangle with rounded corners acting as a placeholder for product images (smartphones, laptops, etc.).  \n\n---  \n\n```canvas\n{\n  \"format\": \"generic-banner\",\n  \"title\": \"Electronics Flash Sale Facebook Ad\",\n  \"background\": {\n    \"type\": \"gradient\",\n    \"gradientType\": \"linear\",\n    \"angle\": 90,\n    \"stops\": [\n      { \"position\": 0, \"colorToken\": \"brand-dark\" },\n      { \"position\": 1, \"colorToken\": \"brand-primary\" }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"layers\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"shape\",\n      \"shape\": \"pill\",\n      \"name\": \"Badge Container\",\n      \"x\": 40,\n      \"y\": 30,\n      \"width\": 180,\n      \"height\": 48,\n      \"colorToken\": \"ember-500\",\n      \"borderRadius\": 999\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"name\": \"Badge Label\",\n      \"content\": \"FLASH SALE\",\n      \"x\": 60,\n      \"y\": 46,\n      \"fontSize\": 18,\n      \"fontWeight\": 700,\n      \"colorToken\": \"white\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"name\": \"Main Headline\",\n      \"content\": \"Electronics\\nFlash Sale\",\n      \"x\": 40,\n      \"y\": 100,\n      \"width\": 560,\n      \"fontSize\": 64,\n      \"fontWeight\": 700,\n      \"lineHeight\": 1.1,\n      \"colorToken\": \"white\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"name\": \"Subhead\",\n      \"content\": \"Up to 70% OFF on top brands. Limited time only!\",\n      \"x\": 40,\n      \"y\": 200,\n      \"width\": 560,\n      \"fontSize\": 28,\n      \"fontWeight\": 400,\n      \"colorToken\": \"cloud\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"shape\",\n      \"shape\": \"pill\",\n      \"name\": \"CTA Button\",\n      \"x\": 40,\n      \"y\": 280,\n      \"width\": 200,\n      \"height\": 60,\n      \"colorToken\": \"brand-accent\",\n      \"borderRadius\": 999\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"name\": \"CTA Label\",\n      \"content\": \"Shop Now →\",\n      \"x\": 70,\n      \"y\": 298,\n      \"fontSize\": 22,\n      \"fontWeight\": 700,\n      \"colorToken\": \"charcoal\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"shape\",\n      \"shape\": \"rectangle\",\n      \"name\": \"Image Placeholder\",\n      \"x\": 660,\n      \"y\": 40,\n      \"width\": 460,\n      \"height\": 320,\n      \"colorToken\": \"stone\",\n      \"borderRadius\": 20\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```', '2026-10-12 04:20:20', 'nobrain-1.4', 982, 1253, 2235, NULL, NULL, 1),
