('553ad385-8d10-4e57-87e4-4eb7c655373f', 'cb173ce3c20139e930b79084890aa03d', 'assistant', 'The current Prime Minister of the United Kingdom as per the information provided and live web facts, which was confirmed on July 20, 2026, is Andy Burnham. He became Prime Minister after accepting an invitation from King Charles III to form a government following Keir Starmer\'s resignation.\n\nAndy Burnham has been serving in this role since that date.\n\n---\n**🌐 Verified with Google Search:**\n- [en.wikipedia.org](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Premiership_of_Andy_Burnham)\n- [gov.uk](https://www.gov.uk/government/people/andy-burnham)\n- [gov.uk](https://www.gov.uk/government/ministers/prime-minister)\n- [en.wikipedia.org](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Prime_Minister_of_the_United_Kingdom)', '2026-10-21 00:21:24', 'nobrain1.0:latest', 640, 76, 716, NULL, NULL, 1),
('55947fda-8331-4d40-a058-f759c866795a', '8967923d765cdef5b6fc58f16ad9d6a7', 'assistant', 'আপনার স্পষ্টতায়, দিলো হল:\n\n1. \"মামা\" - এটা বাংলাতে ছবিরও আছে।\n\n2. \"দিলো নয়\", কারণ \"আছো\" (আস্থা) হল প্যাচ-প্যাটিগুম (একটি এইচ অনুবাদ শব্দের বিভাগ)।\n\n3. \"তোমার\" - এটা আমাকে পছনদিয়ে নেওয়া।\n\n4. \"নাম\" - উইলি।\n\n5. \"কি?\" - এটা অপূর্ণ। তাই, আমরা বলতে হব:\n\n- \"আমি কি?\"\n- \"আপনার নাম কি?\"\n\n6. পিছনে: \n   - এইখানে: নয়\n   - তুই: আপন\n\nসাথে, অর্ধেকটা সমগ্রভাবে:\n\n- \"আবার কি?\"\n- \"আপনার উনিশ্চয় নাম?\"', '2026-10-20 23:56:04', 'nobrain1.0:latest', 169, 362, 531, NULL, NULL, 1),
('56e26729-0a2e-4457-9ced-5a730705db15', '14435c5f75c369ecc6094c1606a0932b', 'assistant', 'Here’s a brand‑new “Dhamaka ⚡️ Flash‑Sale” story. I kept the layout clean but added a burst of colorful confetti, a bold orange‑red gradient, and an explosive typographic style so the design feels truly celebratory.\n\n```canvas\n{\n  \"format\": \"facebook-story\",\n  \"title\": \"Dhamaka Flash Sale – Gadgets\",\n  \"background\": {\n    \"type\": \"gradient\",\n    \"gradientType\": \"linear\",\n    \"angle\": 150,\n    \"stops\": [\n      { \"position\": 0, \"colorToken\": \"ember-500\" },\n      { \"position\": 1, \"color\": \"#0a0a0a\" }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"layers\": [\n\n    /* ==== CONFETTI – background, never collides with text ==== */\n    { \"type\": \"shape\", \"shape\": \"circle\", \"x\": 120, \"y\": 80,  \"size\": 18, \"colorToken\": \"gold-400\" },\n    { \"type\": \"shape\", \"shape\": \"circle\", \"x\": 340, \"y\": 60,  \"size\": 14, \"colorToken\": \"brand-primary\" },\n    { \"type\": \"shape\", \"shape\": \"circle\", \"x\": 560, \"y\": 100, \"size\": 22, \"colorToken\": \"red\" },\n    { \"type\": \"shape\", \"shape\": \"circle\", \"x\": 800, \"y\": 70,  \"size\": 16, \"colorToken\": \"orange\" },\n    { \"type\": \"shape\", \"shape\": \"circle\", \"x\": 200, \"y\": 250, \"size\": 20, \"colorToken\": \"green\" },\n    { \"type\": \"shape\", \"shape\": \"circle\", \"x\": 720, \"y\": 240, \"size\": 12, \"colorToken\": \"brand-accent\" },\n    { \"type\": \"shape\", \"shape\": \"circle\", \"x\": 480, \"y\": 320, \"size\": 18, \"colorToken\": \"gold-400\" },\n    { \"type\": \"shape\", \"shape\": \"circle\", \"x\": 100, \"y\": 500, \"size\": 14, \"colorToken\": \"brand-primary\" },\n    { \"type\": \"shape\", \"shape\": \"circle\", \"x\": 960, \"y\": 580, \"size\": 16, \"colorToken\": \"red\" },\n    { \"type\": \"shape\", \"shape\": \"circle\", \"x\": 300, \"y\": 720, \"size\": 20, \"colorToken\": \"orange\" },\n    { \"type\": \"shape\", \"shape\": \"circle\", \"x\": 850, \"y\": 900, \"size\": 12, \"colorToken\": \"green\" },\n    { \"type\": \"shape\", \"shape\": \"circle\", \"x\": 620, \"y\": 1150,\"size\": 18, \"colorToken\": \"gold-400\" },\n\n    /* ==== EYEBROW BADGE ==== */\n    {\n      \"type\": \"shape\",\n      \"shape\": \"pill\",\n      \"name\": \"Eyebrow Badge\",\n      \"x\": 80,\n      \"y\": 120,\n      \"width\": 260,\n      \"height\": 48,\n      \"colorToken\": \"brand-accent\",\n      \"borderRadius\": 999\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"icon\",\n      \"icon\": \"Zap\",\n      \"x\": 98,\n      \"y\": 132,\n      \"size\": 24,\n      \"colorToken\": \"white\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"FLASH SALE\",\n      \"x\": 140,\n      \"y\": 136,\n      \"fontSize\": 18,\n      \"fontWeight\": 800,\n      \"colorToken\": \"white\"\n    },\n\n    /* ==== MAIN HEADLINE ==== */\n    {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"DHA̱MAKA\\nSALE\",\n      \"x\": 80,\n      \"y\": 190,\n      \"width\": 920,\n      \"fontSize\": 84,\n      \"fontWeight\": 800,\n      \"lineHeight\": 1.15,\n      \"colorToken\": \"white\"\n    },\n\n    /* ==== SUBHEAD ==== */\n    {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"Up to 70% OFF on headphones, smartphones & gaming laptops. Grab it before it’s gone!\",\n      \"x\": 80,\n      \"y\": 410,\n      \"width\": 900,\n      \"fontSize\": 24,\n      \"fontWeight\": 400,\n      \"lineHeight\": 1.35,\n      \"colorToken\": \"cloud\"\n    },\n\n    /* ==== HERO IMAGE FRAME ==== */\n    {\n      \"type\": \"shape\",\n      \"shape\": \"rectangle\",\n      \"name\": \"Hero Frame\",\n      \"x\": 80,\n      \"y\": 470,\n      \"width\": 920,\n      \"height\": 720,\n      \"colorToken\": \"stone\",\n      \"borderRadius\": 28\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"image\",\n      \"name\": \"Hero Image\",\n      \"imageUrl\": \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517336714731-489689fd1ca8?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80\",\n      \"x\": 90,\n      \"y\": 480,\n      \"width\": 900,\n      \"height\": 700,\n      \"borderRadius\": 24,\n      \"fit\": \"cover\"\n    },\n\n    /* ==== DISCOUNT BADGE ==== */\n    {\n      \"type\": \"shape\",\n      \"shape\": \"pill\",\n      \"name\": \"Discount Badge\",\n      \"x\": 80,\n      \"y\": 1230,\n      \"width\": 440,\n      \"height\": 64,\n      \"colorToken\": \"ember-500\",\n      \"borderRadius\": 16\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"icon\",\n      \"icon\": \"Percent\",\n      \"x\": 104,\n      \"y\": 1248,\n      \"size\": 26,\n      \"colorToken\": \"white\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"UP TO 70% OFF\",\n      \"x\": 140,\n      \"y\": 1250,\n      \"fontSize\": 22,\n      \"fontWeight\": 800,\n      \"colorToken\": \"white\"\n    },\n\n    /* ==== TIMER BADGE ==== */\n    {\n      \"type\": \"shape\",\n      \"shape\": \"pill\",\n      \"name\": \"Timer Badge\",\n      \"x\": 560,\n      \"y\": 1230,\n      \"width\": 440,\n      \"height\": 64,\n      \"colorToken\": \"stone\",\n      \"borderRadius\": 16\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"icon\",\n      \"icon\": \"Clock\",\n      \"x\": 584,\n      \"y\": 1248,\n      \"size\": 26,\n      \"colorToken\": \"white\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"ENDS IN 03:45:00\",\n      \"x\": 622,\n      \"y\": 1250,\n      \"fontSize\": 20,\n      \"fontWeight\": 700,\n      \"colorToken\": \"white\"\n    },\n\n    /* ==== CALL‑TO‑ACTION BUTTON ==== */\n    {\n      \"type\": \"shape\",\n      \"shape\": \"pill\",\n      \"name\": \"CTA Button\",\n      \"x\": 80,\n      \"y\": 1330,\n      \"width\": 920,\n      \"height\": 84,\n      \"colorToken\": \"brand-primary\",\n      \"borderRadius\": 999\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"SHOP THE DHOOM – NOW →\",\n      \"x\": 80,\n      \"y\": 1358,\n      \"width\": 920,\n      \"textAlign\": \"center\",\n      \"fontSize\": 26,\n      \"fontWeight\": 800,\n      \"col