('5bc06c21-b3be-444a-94ca-e526dd780b86', '991cd07ebe0674fc1f68335c8fdd2ebb', 'assistant', '<think>\nUser says \"hello\". Likely expects a greeting. Should respond in the language matching user: they wrote in English \"hello\". So respond in English, maybe ask how can help. Use friendly tone. Use markdown.\n</think>\n\n## Hello! 👋\n\nHi there! How can I assist you today? Feel free to ask anything—whether it’s a quick question, a deep‑dive topic, or just a casual chat. I\'m here to help!', '2026-10-28 19:55:16', 'openai.gpt-oss-120b-1:0', 132, 101, 233, NULL, NULL, 1),
