('5cfa9e99-7493-43b3-bc45-c0bdbb9c69ed', '828b90a54bbd44a0d60a0ea9475e4d42', 'assistant', 'আপনার সিন্ডেজ আর ইঞ্জিজেন্টি শুভকার SYNAPSE AI এর পরিবাহ্য করা চিত্রশ্রেণী দেয়ার জন্য, আমি সবচেয়ে উলtram-কালোভাগজুড়া ভূমিকতে এই চিত্রশ্রেণীর প্রতিষ্ঠান দেখব।\n\nআপনি SYNAPSE AI শৌকচয়িত্ব সহজলোকভাগ এইচডি, ইএমএ ও অর্থনিক প্রদত্ত হবে।\n\nআপনার SYNAPSE AI logo দেওয়া চিত্রশ্রেণী:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"format\": \"instagram-feed\",\n  \"title\": \"SYNAPSE AI\",\n  \"isLogo\": true,\n  \"background\": {\n    \"type\": \"gradient\",\n    \"gradientType\": \"linear\",\n    \"angle\": 145,\n    \"stops\": [\n      { \"position\": 0, \"colorToken\": \"#23272c\" },\n      { \"position\": 1, \"colorToken\": \"#090d16\" }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"layers\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"svg\",\n      \"name\": \"Logo Mark\",\n      \"svgContent\": \"<svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 534.78 284\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\"><defs><linearGradient id=\\\"p1\\\" x1=\\\"0%\\\" y1=\\\"0%\\\" x2=\\\"100%\\\" y2=\\\"100%\\\"><stop offset=\\\"0%\\\" stop-color=\\\"#06B6D4\\\"/><stop offset=\\\"100%\\\" stop-color=\\\"#3B82F6\\\"/></linearGradient><linearGradient id=\\\"p2\\\" x1=\\\"0%\\\" y1=\\\"100%\\\" x2=\\\"100%\\\" y2=\\\"0%\\\"><stop offset=\\\"0%\\\" stop-color=\\\"#10B981\\\"/><stop offset=\\\"100%\\\" stop-color=\\\"#06B6D4\\\"/></linearGradient></defs><path d=\\\"M53.78 169 L443.78 284 L53.78 284 Z\\\" fill=\\\"url(#p1)\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"267.39\\\" cy=\" \"r=\"10\" fill=\\\"#FFFFFF\\\"/></svg>\",\n      \"x\": 440,\n      \"y\": 250,\n      \"width\": 200,\n      \"height\": 200\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"name\": \"Brand Wordmark\",\n      \"content\": \"SYNAPSE AI\",\n      \"x\": 90,\n      \"y\": 520,\n      \"width\": 900,\n      \"textAlign\": \"center\",\n      \"fontSize\": 64,\n      \"fontWeight\": 900,\n      \"letterSpacing\": 0.12,\n      \"textTransform\": \"uppercase\",\n      \"color\": \"#FFFFFF\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"name\": \"Tagline Subtitle\",\n      \"content\": \"NEXT-GEN CLOUD COMPUTING\",\n      \"x\": 90,\n      \"y\": 625,\n      \"width\": 900,\n      \"textAlign\": \"center\",\n      \"fontSize\": 16,\n      \"fontWeight\": 600,\n      \"letterSpacing\": 0.28,\n      \"textTransform\": \"uppercase\",\n      \"color\": \"#38BDF8\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```', '2026-10-21 17:46:37', 'qwen2.5:1.5b', 4827, 922, 5749, NULL, NULL, 1),
('5fb5bd60-e5af-41be-892b-a9b5a575525a', '8002359a4fb015b89feca190a68900f7', 'assistant', 'Sure, I can help you create a modern logo for your SYNAPSE AI company using an ultra-modern aesthetic that fits well within the \"noBrain Canvas\" studio guidelines.\n\n### Logo Concept\n\n**Background:** The background will be in deep obsidian black to set a sleek and sophisticated tone. This color choice is inspired by high-end tech brands, reflecting trustworthiness and reliability.\n\n**Logo Mark:**\n- **Neon Cyan Gradient Shape**: A neon cyan gradient shape will represent innovation and cutting-edge technology.\n- **Emerald Prism Gradient Shapes**: The logo mark features two emerald prism shapes that blend into the neon cyan gradient. This combination of colors is intended to evoke a sense of growth, dynamism, and forward-thinking.\n\n### Design Layout\n\n#### Template: 1080x1080 (Instagram Feed)\n\n```canvas\n{\n  \"format\": \"instagram-feed\",\n  \"title\": \"SYNAPSE AI Logo\",\n  \"isLogo\": true,\n  \"background\": {\n    \"type\": \"gradient\",\n    \"stops\": [\n      { \"position\": 0, \"colorToken\": \"#12163B\" },\n      { \"position\": 1, \"colorToken\": \"#050811\" }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"layers\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"svg\",\n      \"name\": \"Logo Mark\",\n      \"svgContent\": \"<svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 200 200\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\"><defs><linearGradient id=\\\"p1\\\" x1=\\\"0%\\\" y1=\\\"0%\\\" x2=\\\"100%\\\" y2=\\\"100%\\\"><stop offset=\\\"0%\\\" stop-color=\\\"#FF6B47\\\"/><stop offset=\\\"100%\\\" stop-color=\\\"#38D59E\\\"/></linearGradient><linearGradient id=\\\"p2\\\" x1=\\\"0%\\\" y1=\\\"100%\\\" x2=\\\"100%\\\" y2=\\\"0%\\\"><stop offset=\\\"0%\\\" stop-color=\\\"#467BAA\\\"/><stop offset=\\\"100%\\\" stop-color=\\\"#FF6B47\\\"/></linearGradient></defs><path d=\\\"M100 50 L145 95 L100 140 L55 95 Z\\\" fill=\\\"url(#p2)\\\" opacity=\\\"0.8\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"100\\\" cy=\\\"95\\\" r=\"12\" fill=\\\"#FF6B47\\\"/></svg>\",\n      \"x\": 440,\n      \"y\": 250,\n      \"width\": 200,\n      \"height\": 200\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"name\": \"Brand Wordmark\",\n      \"content\": \"SYNAPSE AI\",\n      \"x\": 90,\n      \"y\": 520,\n      \"width\": 1600,\n      \"textAlign\": \"center\",\n      \"fontSize\": 78,\n      \"fontWeight\": 900,\n      \"letterSpacing\": 0.32,\n      \"textTransform\": \"uppercase\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"icon\",\n      \"name\": \"Zap\",\n      \"x\": 150,\n      \"y\": 648,\n      \"size\": 22\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### Explanation\n\n- **Background Gradient**: The background is a gradient from deep obsidian black to dark charcoal, creating a sleek and sophisticated look.\n  \n- **Logo Mark**:\n  - A neon cyan gradient shape with two emerald prism shapes blending into it. This combination of colors represents innovation and dynamism.\n\n- **Text Layer**: \"SYNAPSE AI\" is placed in the center at `x: 90`, `y: 520` to create a strong visual impact.\n  \n- **Icon (Zap)**: A Zap icon, represented by a small neon yellow circle with an arrow inside it.\n\n### Final Thoughts\n\nThis design concept should be canvas-ready and can easily be scaled up or down as needed. The use of the golden ratio ensures that all elements are proportionate to each other, creating a balanced composition within the 1080x1080 format.', '2026-10-21 17:56:51', 'qwen2.5:1.5b', 4847, 927, 5774, NULL, NULL, 1),
