('83dfb1d2-47ba-4428-91f2-4aa43f7ba669', 'b4e8b9b40b3cceddfd42d0694b9ab37f', 'assistant', 'As of October 12, 2026, there is no longer an interim government in Bangladesh led by a chief adviser. Muhammad Yunus was appointed as the Chief Adviser to the interim government of Bangladesh on August 8, 2024. He was sworn in by President Mohammed Shahabuddin.\n\nHowever, Muhammad Yunus\'s tenure as Chief Adviser ended on February 17, 2026. Following the 12th national election, Tarique Rahman took office as Prime Minister with a new cabinet on February 17, 2026, marking the conclusion of the interim government that Muhammad Yunus led.\n\n---\n**🌐 Google Search Sources:**\n- [wikipedia.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHejJp3E_xqeeqdY0at0YDcShFQSoxk2ljOJfz-tM3ci6x-697Q6eAQTWJiIsN0fvh6CixDSu9aQ7ocCAXv7mCJBndKUqdB8b3P8lLyyqU7UCR8hCIIcr5AnXPcytXlftw6YKVmyhda)\n- [wikipedia.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFGc8IXYfWejymLm-FLR5edaetwzj36XagWpQNZlQCc4cewQOwB483ZFRCaHduzxflhu1pA8FfKfg50dSXWvpAMalBV-7Mgb8vDGBjKU0q1-z_kz0ddUdFHkwunwURzHce_UfKp6xBgWEwdyMkm3RLekzv_wTJTq1c48pqqGg==)\n- [wikipedia.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEa-PmpTPwSL9tPy7glzskQezzHDBgXtpA_xXn2me4dwmYq4D7ru5gd9rwfb60YJoJmOMFlWRnAMcs7rH5sazONe0dCbXX4imFb19zKd2ak5bOMJBHbvOs5jBhRmEuK7fxbHdbVZYSm)\n- [bssnews.net](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG4JwaG0mRal351HoTxGBAgz44ZN8tkJbbea2uehUHR9jmN6zfALmsFsz4L1QXPReCuhCtqcBLPGEvrqH6YXtfkkhXXjxVDKH5qucw-Z6Qe3NX_7e33T14W9QCjSL2Y9efj8iuMyRdm)\n- [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH6tPdVo3g3ks0CPbuDpWVlSB1RK0qOXobMzGXuP9X3eFiCeKMhJnPk-B2G5YJVZE81i-A-2b0OF_wCI8Lqx1OUFb1tJHw8H75cXuCGAWOmZO2iwa4mIZ8x2Ga-JsWL-iAjfbWIZdg=)', '2026-10-12 02:51:05', 'models/gemini-2.5-flash', 30, 161, 518, NULL, NULL, 1),
