('937b84d2-3553-4b0c-82b1-3a335a75eda1', 'f29ac8eceb324750ab7ce4b017128852', 'assistant', 'The Prime Minister of Bangladesh in 2026 was Tarique Rahman. He took office on February 17, 2026 following a landslide electoral victory for his party, the Bangladesh Nationalist Party (BNP).\n\n---\n**🌐 Verified with Google Search:**\n- [en.wikipedia.org](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Premiership_of_Tarique_Rahman)\n- [bangladeshexport.com](https://bangladeshexport.com/leader/tarique-rahman)\n- [en.wikipedia.org](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tarique_Rahman_ministry)\n- [mediabangladesh.net](https://www.mediabangladesh.net/bangladesh-cabinet-ministers-2026-election-insights/)', '2026-10-21 15:32:20', 'qwen2.5:1.5b', 744, 49, 793, NULL, NULL, 1),
