('9c92d978-0790-45d6-a70f-a86c772c1c1d', 'e5cb64dbbf2f1632fd4ebc26056e2078', 'assistant', 'The current Prime Minister of the United Kingdom as of July 2026 is Andy Burnham. He took office on July 20, 2026, succeeding Keir Starmer.\n\nAndy Burnham was previously elected Member of Parliament for Leigh in June 2001 and served as Chief Secretary to the Treasury from 2007 to 2010 before becoming Prime Minister.\n\n---\n**🌐 Verified with Google Search:**\n- [en.wikipedia.org](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Premiership_of_Andy_Burnham)\n- [gov.uk](https://www.gov.uk/government/people/andy-burnham)\n- [gov.uk](https://www.gov.uk/government/ministers/prime-minister)\n- [en.wikipedia.org](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Prime_Minister_of_the_United_Kingdom)', '2026-10-21 00:19:42', 'nobrain1.0:latest', 640, 86, 726, NULL, NULL, 1),
