('b193e216-bb59-4579-88bf-bdbe8fe22a05', '70d05dde287bdbe3418fbe25109f809d', 'assistant', 'Here’s a bold, tech‑savvy Facebook Story that highlights a limited‑time flash sale on electronics – eye‑catching headline, a countdown badge, and a bright “Shop Now” CTA.\n\n```canvas\n{\n  \"format\": \"facebook-story\",\n  \"title\": \"Electronics Flash Sale\",\n  \"background\": {\n    \"type\": \"gradient\",\n    \"gradientType\": \"linear\",\n    \"angle\": 135,\n    \"stops\": [\n      { \"position\": 0, \"colorToken\": \"brand-dark\" },\n      { \"position\": 1, \"colorToken\": \"brand-primary\" }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"layers\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"shape\",\n      \"shape\": \"rectangle\",\n      \"name\": \"Top Banner\",\n      \"x\": 0,\n      \"y\": 0,\n      \"width\": 1080,\n      \"height\": 260,\n      \"colorToken\": \"ember-500\",\n      \"borderRadius\": 0\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"name\": \"Main Headline\",\n      \"content\": \"⚡ FLASH SALE ⚡\",\n      \"x\": 540,\n      \"y\": 80,\n      \"fontSize\": 72,\n      \"fontWeight\": 800,\n      \"colorToken\": \"white\",\n      \"textAlign\": \"center\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"name\": \"Subheadline\",\n      \"content\": \"Up to 70% OFF on Gadgets & Gear\",\n      \"x\": 540,\n      \"y\": 170,\n      \"fontSize\": 36,\n      \"fontWeight\": 600,\n      \"colorToken\": \"white\",\n      \"textAlign\": \"center\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"shape\",\n      \"shape\": \"pill\",\n      \"name\": \"Timer Badge\",\n      \"x\": 540,\n      \"y\": 320,\n      \"width\": 360,\n      \"height\": 80,\n      \"colorToken\": \"red\",\n      \"borderRadius\": 999\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"name\": \"Timer Text\",\n      \"content\": \"02:15:00 LEFT\",\n      \"x\": 540,\n      \"y\": 340,\n      \"fontSize\": 32,\n      \"fontWeight\": 700,\n      \"colorToken\": \"white\",\n      \"textAlign\": \"center\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \