('d7b0edf5-382b-4a90-bafe-f3d6431bea2e', '07b8a2d9d3ea87737a9cb3cc149572e1', 'assistant', 'Here’s a clean, eye‑catching banner for your Flash Sale – bold headline, a small “FLASH SALE” badge, brief details and a bright “Shop Now” button.\n\n```canvas\n{\n  \"format\": \"generic-banner\",\n  \"title\": \"Flash Sale Banner\",\n  \"background\": {\n    \"type\": \"gradient\",\n    \"gradientType\": \"linear\",\n    \"angle\": 90,\n    \"stops\": [\n      { \"position\": 0, \"colorToken\": \"brand-primary\" },\n      { \"position\": 1, \"colorToken\": \"brand-dark\" }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"layers\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"shape\",\n      \"shape\": \"pill\",\n      \"name\": \"Badge Container\",\n      \"x\": 40,\n      \"y\": 40,\n      \"width\": 180,\n      \"height\": 48,\n      \"colorToken\": \"ember-500\",\n      \"borderRadius\": 999\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"name\": \"Badge Label\",\n      \"content\": \"FLASH SALE\",\n      \"x\": 58,\n      \"y\": 58,\n      \"fontSize\": 18,\n      \"fontWeight\": 700,\n      \"colorToken\": \"white\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"name\": \"Main Headline\",\n      \"content\": \"FLASH SALE\\n70% OFF\",\n      \"x\": 40,\n      \"y\": 120,\n      \"width\": 1120,\n      \"fontSize\": 72,\n      \"fontWeight\": 800,\n      \"lineHeight\": 1.1,\n      \"colorToken\": \"white\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"name\": \"Subhead\",\n      \"content\": \"Limited time only – grab your favourites now!\",\n      \"x\": 40,\n      \"y\": 260,\n      \"width\": 1120,\n      \"fontSize\": 28,\n      \"fontWeight\": 400,\n      \"colorToken\": \"cloud\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"shape\",\n      \"shape\": \"pill\",\n      \"name\": \"CTA Button\",\n      \"x\": 880,\n      \"y\": 300,\n      \"width\": 260,\n      \"height\": 68,\n      \"colorToken\": \"brand-accent\",\n      \"borderRadius\": 999\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"name\": \"CTA Label\",\n      \"content\": \"Shop Now →\",\n      \"x\": 910,\n      \"y\": 318,\n      \"fontSize\": 22,\n      \"fontWeight\": 700,\n      \"colorToken\": \"charcoal\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\nFeel free to tweak the colors or copy‑text to match your brand’s exact tone. Enjoy the sale!', '2026-10-12 04:29:53', 'nobrain-1.4', 1019, 717, 1736, NULL, NULL, 1),
('da7a135d-ca66-4563-acc0-eaea83717fb8', 'bd3dfbb658f55178fc7fff9ff8f1521e', 'user', 'Bro, design an ultra-modern logo for my new cloud and AI startup, SYNAPSE AI. The background should be deep obsidian black, with the logo mark featuring neon cyan and emerald prism gradient shapes. Maintain the golden ratio and make the design canvas-ready.', '2026-10-21 18:29:13', 'qwen2.5:1.5b', 65, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 1),
