('ee752c28-1afd-4475-9cd7-2f5e453e0240', '46c5b0d3a9a606897b6ac60bd6237c00', 'assistant', 'Here’s a sleek, tech‑inspired Facebook Story layout that highlights a limited‑time flash sale on electronics. The bold “FLASH SALE” headline, a countdown badge, and a bright “Shop Now” CTA make the offer pop on mobile screens.\n\n```canvas\n{\n  \"format\": \"facebook-story\",\n  \"title\": \"Electronics Flash Sale\",\n  \"background\": {\n    \"type\": \"gradient\",\n    \"gradientType\": \"linear\",\n    \"angle\": 135,\n    \"stops\": [\n      { \"position\": 0, \"colorToken\": \"brand-dark\" },\n      { \"position\": 1, \"colorToken\": \"brand-primary\" }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"layers\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"shape\",\n      \"shape\": \"pill\",\n      \"name\": \"Countdown Badge\",\n      \"x\": 80,\n      \"y\": 100,\n      \"width\": 200,\n      \"height\": 56,\n      \"colorToken\": \"ember-500\",\n      \"borderRadius\": 999\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"name\": \"Badge Text\",\n      \"content\": \"02:15:00 LEFT\",\n      \"x\": 100,\n      \"y\": 118,\n      \"fontSize\": 22,\n      \"fontWeight\": 700,\n      \"colorToken\": \"white\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"name\": \"Main Headline\",\n      \"content\": \"FLASH SALE\",\n      \"x\": 80,\n      \"y\": 300,\n      \"fontSize\": 110,\n      \"fontWeight\": 800,\n      \"lineHeight\": 1,\n      \"colorToken\": \"white\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"name\": \"Subheadline\",\n      \"content\": \"Up to 70% OFF\\non Electronics\",\n      \"x\": 80,\n      \"y\": 460,\n      \"width\": 920,\n      \"fontSize\": 48,\n      \"fontWeight\": 600,\n      \"lineHeight\": 1.2,\n      \"colorToken\": \"gold-400\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"shape\",\n      \"shape\": \"pill\",\n      \"name\": \"CTA Button\",\n      \"x\": 140,\n      \"y\": 1500,\n      \"width\": 800,\n      \"height\": 100,\n      \"colorToken\": \"brand-accent\",\n      \"borderRadius\": 999\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"name\": \"CTA Label\",\n      \"content\": \"SHOP NOW →\",\n      \"x\": 210,\n      \"y\": 1520,\n      \"fontSize\": 36,\n      \"fontWeight\": 700,\n      \"colorToken\": \"charcoal\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"name\": \"Fine Print\",\n      \"content\": \"*Limited stock. Terms apply.\",\n      \"x\": 80,\n      \"y\": 1750,\n      \"fontSize\": 24,\n      \"fontWeight\": 400,\n      \"colorToken\": \"cloud\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\nThis composition fits the 1080 × 1920 canvas, uses bold colors for high visibility, and places the CTA near the bottom where viewers naturally tap. Enjoy your flash‑sale promotion!', '2026-10-12 07:00:17', 'nobrain-1.4', 1034, 871, 1905, NULL, NULL, 1),
